485	/**
486	 * Add a mailbox to a subscription the caller owns. Enforces the plan's mailbox
487	 * quota and address uniqueness within the subscription, records the intended
488	 * mailbox (status PROVISIONING), then attempts to provision it on Mailcow. A
489	 * Mailcow failure leaves the row as FAILED (retryable) but never fails the call.
